 false}, {"chunk_id": "COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0011", "ticker": "COST", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "section": "business", "score": 0.9554, "filing_name": "Costco Wholesale Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000101/cost-20250831.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0005", "ticker": "COST", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "section": "business", "score": 0.9303, "filing_name": "Costco Wholesale Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000101/cost-20250831.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0015", "ticker": "COST", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "section": "business", "score": 0.3679, "filing_name": "Costco Wholesale Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000101/cost-20250831.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "COST_10K_2025-08-31__mdna__0000", "ticker": "COST", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.9719, "filing_name": "Costco Wholesale Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000101/cost-20250831.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "COST_10K_2025-08-31__mdna__0001", "ticker": "COST", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.9241, "filing_name": "Costco Wholesale Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000101/cost-20250831.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "COST_10K_2025-08-31__mdna__0021", "ticker": "COST", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.7357, "filing_name": "Costco Wholesale Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000101/cost-20250831.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "COST_10K_2025-08-31__mdna__0002", "ticker": "COST", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.629, "filing_name": "Costco Wholesale Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000101/cost-20250831.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "COST_10K_2025-08-31__mdna__0003", "ticker": "COST", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.5213, "filing_name": "Costco Wholesale Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000101/cost-20250831.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "COST_10K_2025-08-31__risk_factors__0010", "ticker": "COST", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "section": "risk_factors", "score": 0.6422, "filing_name": "Costco Wholesale Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000101/cost-20250831.htm", "truncated": false}], "collapsed_near_duplicates": 17, "dropped_candidates": 258, "token_estimate": 31380, "gaps": [], "degraded": []}, "answer": {"direct_answer": "All three are mass-market retailers built on low prices, but their models differ. Walmart (fiscal 2025, ended January 31, 2025) describes itself as a \"people-led, technology-powered omni-channel retailer\" serving about 270 million customers weekly across 19 countries, with three segments [WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0000]. Target (fiscal 2025, ended February 1, 2025) operates as a single segment offering \"fashionable, differentiated merchandise and everyday essentials at discounted prices,\" with nearly all sales in the U.S. [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0000] [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0017]. Costco (fiscal 2025, ended August 31, 2025) operates membership warehouses in 14 named countries and territories, 914 warehouses worldwide [COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0000], with a limited selection of fewer than 4,000 SKUs per warehouse [COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0002]. Costco names Walmart, Target, Kroger, and Amazon among its significant general merchandise retail competitors in the U.S. [COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0010].", "company_findings": [{"ticker": "WMT", "company": "Walmart Inc", "findings": [{"point": "Walmart's strategy centers on price leadership through EDLP (everyday low prices) supported by EDLC (everyday low cost), and omni-channel integration of stores and eCommerce.", "citations": ["WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0000"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Walmart has three reportable segments: Walmart U.S. (net sales of $462.4 billion in fiscal 2025, 69% of consolidated net sales), Walmart International ($121.9 billion, 18%), and Sam's Club U.S. ($90.2 billion, 13%).", "citations": ["WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0003", "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0007"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Beyond retail, Walmart is expanding offerings such as advertising, marketplace and fulfillment services, and financial services, and runs Walmart+ and membership-only Sam's Club.", "citations": ["WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0002", "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0010"], "unverified": false}]}, {"ticker": "TGT", "company": "Target Corporation", "findings": [{"point": "Target's corporate purpose is to help all families discover the joy of everyday life, and it operates as a single segment serving guests in stores or digital channels.", "citations": ["TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0000"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Stores act as fulfillment hubs, fulfilling more than 96 percent of total Merchandise Sales in each of the last three years, and other revenue comes mainly from advertising and credit card profit-sharing.", "citations": ["TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0003"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Approximately one-third of Merchandise Sales come from owned and exclusive brands, and the Target Circle loyalty program and Roundel and Target Plus businesses support its strategy.", "citations": ["TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0009", "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0001"], "unverified": false}]}, {"ticker": "COST", "company": "Costco Wholesale Corporation", "findings": [{"point": "Costco's model offers low prices on a limited selection of nationally-branded and private-label products to drive high sales volumes and rapid inventory turnover, enabling profitable operation at significantly lower gross margins than most other retailers.", "citations": ["COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0001"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Membership is integral to the business: total paid members were 81,000 thousand at the end of fiscal 2025, and Executive members represented approximately 73.6% of worldwide net sales.", "citations": ["COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0006", "COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0005"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Gasoline represented approximately 10% of total net sales and e-commerce approximately 7% in fiscal 2025, and the Kirkland Signature private label is expected to increase in sales penetration.", "citations": ["COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0003", "COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0011"], "unverified": false}]}], "comparison_table": {"columns": ["Dimension", "Walmart (FY2025, ended Jan 31, 2025)", "Target (FY2025, ended Feb 1, 2025)", "Costco (FY2025, ended Aug 31, 2025)"], "rows": [["Format", "Omni-channel stores, eCommerce, Sam's Club [WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0000]", "Stores plus digital channels, single segment [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0000]", "Membership warehouses and e-commerce sites [COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0000]"], ["Geography", "19 countries [WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0000]", "Nearly all sales in the U.S. [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0017]", "Operates in the U.S. and 13 other named countries/territories [COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0000]"], ["Pricing approach", "EDLP and EDLC [WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0000]", "Everyday low pricing plus promotions and Target Circle [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0001]", "Low prices on limited selection, high turnover [COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0001]"], ["Membership/loyalty", "Walmart+ and Sam's Club [WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0003]", "Target Circle, Target Circle 360 paid option [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0011]", "Paid membership; $65 annual fee in the U.S. [COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0004]"], ["Store/warehouse count", "Over 10,750 stores [WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0000]", "Not stated in provided chunks", "914 warehouses [COST_10K_2025-08-31__business__0000]"]]}, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0000", "claim": "Walmart describes itself as an omni-channel retailer serving about 270 million customers weekly in 19 countries with EDLP/EDLC", "quote": "people-led, technology-powered omni-channel retailer"}, {"chunk_id": "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0003", "claim": "Walmart U.S. net sales of $462.4 billion, 69% of consolidated net sales", "quote": "Walmart U.S. had net sales of $462.4 billion for fiscal 2025, representing 69%"}, {"chunk_id": "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0007", "claim": "Walmart International net sales of $121.9 billion, 18% of consolidated", "quote": "Walmart International had net sales of $121.9 billion for fiscal 2025, representing 18%"}, {"chunk_id": "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0002", "claim": "Walmart expanding advertising, marketplace and fulfillment services, and financial services", "quote": "offerings such as advertising, marketplace and fulfillment services, and financial services"}, {"chunk_id": "WMT_10K_2025-01-31__business__0010", "claim": "Sam's Club U.S. is membership-only with $90.2 billion net sales, 13% of consolidated", "quote": "Sam's Club U.S. had net sales of $90.2 billion for fiscal 2025, representing 13%"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-0